00:06:31.330 --> 00:06:33.160
I think traditional
data warehouses

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:38.260
have this problem where they
all teach people to cleanse,

00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:40.730
reduce, aggregate, store.

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:44.120
The whole idea is how do
you not get more data?

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:46.490
It's like you reduce your
costs by aggregating,

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:48.020
