cleansing, and all

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:51.260
of that versus what cloud
platforms allow you to do

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:54.470
is collect first and
then analyze, figure out

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:55.580
what's valuable.

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:58.070
And that's where, actually,
the real value comes in.

00:06:58.070 --> 00:06:59.930
We have customers
that have literally

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:03.080
